+++ b/changelog/69912.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added ``beacons.list_status`` to report, per configured beacon, when it last actually fired and whether that run raised an error. The status is tracked live in the minion's in-process ``Beacon`` object as beacons execute, so it reflects real activity immediately without waiting for a new probe cycle, reading logs, or restarting the minion. Beacons that haven't fired yet are reported with ``has_run: False`` instead of a stale or fabricated value.
